      "mergeID": "66fc21dce9c44ee54ac787c7",
      "mergedPostDetails": "If you are multi client world testing doing new builds, eventually you will not be able to login anymore getting the error in the title. VRCX will show you stuck in your homeworld for hours even with the game closed and computer fully restarted. The effect seems to last a few hours before it settles itself on the server. Neither the normal game client nor testing allow login. \n\nMost likely a server side bug getting your account stuck in limbo in the api. I have never had this happen since world building from 2018-now, this is the first time.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Multi-Client testing gives \"Failed to authenticate with the realtime servers\"",
